---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Model card · SketchSense"
  description="SketchSense compact CNN evidence and limitations."
>
  <main class="container document-page">
    <a href={`${base}en/`}>← Back to SketchSense</a><h1>Model card</h1><p>
      The compact-cnn-v1 model classifies drawings across 16 Quick, Draw!
      categories. It runs locally in the browser and never transmits the
      drawing.
    </p><h2>Measured evaluation</h2><p>
      On the locked 480-sample held-out test split: 72.71% accuracy, 74.70%
      macro precision, 72.71% macro recall, 73.19% macro F1, and 86.88% top-3
      accuracy.
    </p><h2>Architecture and artifact</h2><p>
      Two convolution blocks and a two-layer classifier contain 106,256
      parameters. The fixed-batch ONNX opset 18 artifact is 441,021 bytes and
      outputs 16 logits.
    </p><h2>Limitations</h2><p>
      The small deterministic subset has only 200 examples per class. Ambiguous,
      unusual, faint, or out-of-distribution sketches may be wrong and
      confidence is not calibrated probability. The model is an educational
      portfolio demonstration, not a safety-critical classifier.
    </p><p>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/SebastianGaray/sketchsense/blob/main/docs/model-card.md"
        >Full reproducibility record on GitHub</a
      >
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
